<title>UK: Millennium &amp; Copthorne yr proforma profit up.</title>
<headline>Millennium &amp; Copthorne yr proforma profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>				 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.0		    vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 4.7		    vs N/A</p>
<p> Pretax		     39.3		   vs 24.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   179.3		  vs 159.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Above results are proforma, as if Millennium &amp; Copthorne Hotels Plc had been in existence on January 1, 1995. On a statutory basis, earnings per share was 23.7p versus 10.0p.</p>
<p>The total dividend was for the eight-month period since the company's flotation.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
